      "sourceTextSha256": "8d1fd753463db756fb8fe5fab8253cebc0791dc8f58ba23964eaaa02d49755c9",
      "text": "After breakfast, board the train to Aguas Calientes, travelling through the spectacular Sacred Valley alongside the Urubamba River. From Aguas Calientes, continue by bus to the legendary Machu Picchu, the remarkable Inca citadel set dramatically between the mountains.\n\nEnjoy a guided visit of its ancient temples, terraces and stone structures and discover the fascinating history of this extraordinary archaeological site, brought to international attention in 1911. After lunch, return by train to Cusco and transfer to your hotel.\n\nIncluded: Train to Aguas Calientes · Bus and entrance ticket · Guided visit (shared, English-speaking guide) · Lunch · Breakfast",
      "provenance": {
